@startuml BlackoutRadar_DomainOverview

title BlackoutRadar — Domain Overview

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam RectangleRoundCorner 15

rectangle "User" as User
rectangle "Subscription" as Subscription
rectangle "Address" as Address
rectangle "Power Outage" as Outage
rectangle "Notification" as Notification

User --> Subscription : owns

Subscription --> Address : monitors

Outage --> Address : affects

Outage --> Notification : creates

Notification --> User : delivered to

@enduml